        "shipping_returns_content": "<p><strong>Made only when you order.</strong> We don’t print in bulk or hold warehouse stock — every piece is printed after your order comes in, so nothing is overproduced and nothing goes to waste.</p><p>We dispatch within <strong>2 business days</strong> and delivery takes <strong>5–7 days</strong> after dispatch. UK delivery is <strong>free on every order</strong>, fully tracked, rolled in a rigid tube so it arrives flat and unmarked.</p><p><strong>Changed your mind?</strong> Return any unused print in its original packaging within 30 days of delivery for a full refund — email <a href=\"mailto:support@posterandform.com\">support@posterandform.com</a> and we’ll sort it.</p>",
